is real but unreachable here — closing it requires a custom kernel, which the ULP-level tolerance forecloses. This problem is effectively locked to the reference implementation.","ttft_ms":4617,"ttft_stream_ms":4616,"time_to_request_ms":90,"type":"result","duration_ms":983504,"uuid":"1f1115ea-abb2-4d6f-b148-b0574ac58ecd"}
